        <mxCell id="voZz9ndLkRwJSmnllFXi-7" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;AWS Managed&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1132" y="-1339.5" width="198" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="voZz9ndLkRwJSmnllFXi-8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.433;entryY=0.507;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="yes5yoXh_P5L6847bj87-12" target="yes5yoXh_P5L6847bj87-32">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="voZz9ndLkRwJSmnllFXi-9" value="&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-1b5d3aba-7fff-e3d9-7839-7c37fe5b90f2&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:9pt;margin-bottom:9pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;Each VPC creates a VPC Interface Endpoint (PrivateLink). This provisions an ENI (Elastic Network Interface) with a private IP address inside that VPC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li aria-level=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;list-style-type: disc; font-size: 9pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p role=&quot;presentation&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;margin-top:9pt;margin-bottom:0pt;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-wrap-mode: wrap;&quot;&gt;When HDB / Tableau calls Athena, the private DNS will resolve to the local ENI private IP instead of the Athena public one so that traffic never leaves private network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="934" y="-917" width="608" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
